msgid ""
"This will now load `shell.nix` from the script's directory, if it exists; "
"`default.nix` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:30
msgid ""
"The old behavior can be opted into by setting the option [`nix-shell-always-"
"looks-for-shell-nix`](../command-ref/conf-file.md#conf-nix-shell-always-"
"looks-for-shell-nix) to `false`."
