"(https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/9054) [\\#11072](https://github.com/NixOS/"
"nix/pull/11072)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:36
msgid ""
"`nix repl` has a `:doc` command that previously only rendered documentation "
"for internally defined functions. This feature has been extended to also "
"render function documentation comments, in accordance with [RFC 145](https://"
"github.com/NixOS/rfcs/pull/145)."
msgstr ""

