#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:128
msgid ""
"Introduce `libnixflake` [\\#9063](https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/9063)"
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:130
msgid ""
"A new library, `libnixflake`, has been introduced to better separate the "
"Flakes layer within Nix. This change refactors the codebase to encapsulate "
"Flakes-specific functionality within its own library."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:132
msgid ""
"See the commits in the pull request for detailed changes, with the only "
"significant code modifications happening in the initial commit."
msgstr ""

#: source/release-notes/rl-2.24.md:134
msgid ""
"This change was alluded to in [RFC 134](https://github.com/nixos/rfcs/blob/"
"master/rfcs/0134-nix-store-layer.md) and is a step towards a more modular "
"and maintainable codebase."
